# Publication fixtures

Envelopes and templates for increment 2 (publication and desktop tools).

- `envelopes/valid/` — must be accepted: Excel mass budget (CALC-HYD-03), Simulink
  changeover model (SIM-HYD-02), OpenModelica pump transient on SKID-400 (SIM-SKID-05).
- `envelopes/invalid/` — must be rejected with the reason code in `expected.json`.
- `templates/mass-budget-template.xlsx` — controlled template EDA-TPL-MASS-BUDGET 1.0 with
  defined names `EDA_IN_*`, `EDA_PAR_*`, `EDA_OUT_*`, `EDA_ENV_*`. Example values are
  illustrative; total 108.5 kg, margin 9.5 kg against HYD-REQ-041 (118 kg).

Published results (CALC-HYD-03, SIM-HYD-02, SIM-SKID-05) are not in `artefacts.json`: they
receive their URI from the Resolver when the publication is accepted.
